    {
      "content": "For a fixed integer n > 1, define f_n(x) = floor(n*x) - sum_{k=1}^n floor(k*x)/k for real x.",
      "kind": "definition",
      "label": "f_n"
    },
    {
      "content": "For a fixed integer n > 1, define H_n = sum_{k=1}^n 1/k.",
      "kind": "definition",
      "label": "H_n"
    },
    {
      "content": "For a real x, frac(x) = x - floor(x), so frac(x) is the fractional part of x and lies in [0,1).",
      "kind": "notation",
      "label": "frac"
    }
